Effect: (constraint_applied ?candidate) (not (operational_constraint_available ?operational_constraint)).

Thus need candidate_prepared, candidate_task_profile_linked, operational_constraint_available (we have operational_constraint_alpha available initially, but note that after applying it, it becomes not available). Also need candidate_operational_constraint_linked (we have for shift_candidate_alpha linked to operational_constraint_alpha initially). Good.

Candidate_prepared from action confirm_candidate_preparedness:
precondition: (candidate_created ?candidate) (vehicle_allocated ?candidate) (candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile) (not (candidate_prepared ?candidate)).
Effect: candidate_prepared ?candidate.

Thus need candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, candidate_task_profile_linked.

Candidate_task_profile_linked from attach_task_profile:
precondition: (candidate_created ?candidate) (vehicle_allocated ?candidate) (route_task_profile_available ?route_task_profile).
Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked and not route_task_profile_available.

