Candidate_clearance_established can be achieved via one of the establish_clearance_* actions. They require candidate_loading_verified, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, and certain leg loaded flags (origin_leg_loaded, destination_leg_loaded). Also require not candidate_clearance_established.

